-- clean: حروف وأرقام بس، صغيرة (عشان "Hero of Ten (Big Chill)" تطابق)
local function clean(s) return (tostring(s):lower():gsub("[^%w]", "")) end

local function prettify(key)
    return (key:gsub("_", " "):gsub("(%a)(%w*)", function(a, b) return a:upper() .. b end))
end

local nameToIds = {} -- [clean(name)] = { primaryId, skin, skin, ... }

local function addId(name, id, front)
    local key = clean(name)
    local list = nameToIds[key]
    if not list then list = {} nameToIds[key] = list end
    for _, x in ipairs(list) do if x == id then return false end end
    if front then table.insert(list, 1, id) else table.insert(list, id) end
    return true
end

